{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>והפלה</b> — twice in the Masorah: here and the other, והפלא ה' את מכותך. To teach: just as there, a blow to the body, so too here, a blow to the body. Therefore here is written with heh — for after five plagues they were struck in their bodies with boils, which is the sixth plague — and there is written with alef, to teach that the most distinguished among judges issues the warning. And we learn there from here: one who was flogged and repeated is not warned again, for every third plague was without warning:"], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:17.934445523Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}